h3 MCP
p(translate) Allow agents to discover Tabby connections through Model Context Protocol.

.form-line
    .header
        .title(translate) Enable MCP server
        .description(translate) Listen on this computer only. Requests require a bearer token and an unlocked vault.
    toggle([ngModel]='mcp.settings.enabled', (ngModelChange)='saveSettings($event)', [disabled]='busy')

.form-line
    .header
        label.title(for='mcp-port', translate) Port
        .description(translate) Leave empty to reuse the previous automatic port, or choose a free port automatically.
    input#mcp-port.form-control(type='number', min='1', max='65535', [(ngModel)]='port', [disabled]='busy')
    button.btn.btn-secondary.ms-2((click)='saveSettings()', [disabled]='busy', translate) Apply

.mb-3
    div {{previewAddress}}
    div(*ngIf='mcp.address')
        span(translate) Running at:
        code.ms-2 {{mcp.address}}
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-secondary.ms-2((click)='copy(mcp.address!)', translate) Copy
    .text-muted(*ngIf='!mcp.address && !mcp.error', translate) Server is stopped or managed by the main window.
.alert.alert-danger(*ngIf='mcp.error') {{mcp.error | translate}}
.alert.alert-danger(*ngIf='error') {{error | translate}}
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='!mcp.isMainWindow', translate) MCP runs in the main window. Unlock the vault in that window before connecting an agent.

.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='!vault.isEnabled()', translate) Configure the vault in Vault settings before creating tokens.
.alert.alert-info(*ngIf='vault.isEnabled() && !vault.isOpen()')
    p(translate) Unlock the vault to allow MCP requests. Requests are rejected while it is locked.
    button.btn.btn-secondary((click)='unlockVault()', [disabled]='busy || !mcp.isMainWindow', translate) Unlock vault

h4(translate) Tokens
p(translate) Use Authorization: Bearer TOKEN when connecting an agent. Each token has its own tools and connection access.
.list-group.mb-3
    .list-group-item.d-flex.align-items-center(*ngFor='let token of mcp.settings.tokens')
        span.me-auto {{token.name}}
        button.btn.btn-secondary.ms-2((click)='openEditor(token)', [disabled]='busy || !!createdToken', translate) Edit permissions
        button.btn.btn-danger.ms-2((click)='removeToken(token)', [disabled]='busy', translate) Revoke
button.btn.btn-primary.mb-3((click)='openEditor()', [disabled]='busy || !vault.isEnabled() || !!createdToken', translate) Create token

.alert.alert-warning(*ngIf='createdToken')
    p(translate) Copy this token now. It will only be shown once.
    code.d-block.text-break {{createdToken}}
    button.btn.btn-secondary.mt-2((click)='copy(createdToken!)', translate) Copy token
    button.btn.btn-primary.mt-2.ms-2((click)='createdToken = null', translate) Done

fieldset(*ngIf='editorOpen', [disabled]='busy')
    legend(translate) Token permissions
    label.form-label(for='mcp-token-name', translate) Name
    input#mcp-token-name.form-control.mb-3([(ngModel)]='name', [disabled]='!!editing', maxlength='200')

    h5(translate) Available tools
    label.d-block(*ngFor='let tool of tools')
        input.form-check-input.me-2(type='checkbox', [ngModel]='permissions.tools.includes(tool.name)', (ngModelChange)='toggleSelection(permissions.tools, tool.name, $event)')
        span {{tool.name}}
        small.text-muted.ms-2 {{tool.description | translate}}

    h5.mt-3(translate) Available groups
    select.form-select.mb-2([(ngModel)]='permissions.groups.mode', [attr.aria-label]='"Available groups" | translate')
        option(value='all', translate) All
        option(value='custom', translate) Custom
    p.text-muted(translate) Selecting a group grants all its current and future connections. Subgroups are selected separately.
    div(*ngIf='permissions.groups.mode === "custom"')
        label.d-block(*ngFor='let group of catalog.groups')
            input.form-check-input.me-2(type='checkbox', [ngModel]='permissions.groups.ids.includes(group.id)', (ngModelChange)='toggleSelection(permissions.groups.ids, group.id, $event)')
            span {{group.name}}

    h5.mt-3(translate) Available connections
    select.form-select.mb-2([(ngModel)]='permissions.connections.mode', [attr.aria-label]='"Available connections" | translate')
        option(value='all', translate) All
        option(value='custom', translate) Custom
    p.text-muted(translate) Individual selections grant only those connections. Their groups are visible, but other connections in those groups remain hidden.
    div(*ngIf='permissions.connections.mode === "custom"')
        label.d-block(*ngFor='let connection of catalog.connections')
            input.form-check-input.me-2(type='checkbox', [ngModel]='permissions.connections.ids.includes(connection.id)', (ngModelChange)='toggleSelection(permissions.connections.ids, connection.id, $event)')
            span {{connection.name}} ({{connection.type}})

    button.btn.btn-primary.mt-3((click)='saveToken()', [disabled]='!name.trim()', translate) Save
    button.btn.btn-secondary.mt-3.ms-2((click)='editorOpen = false', translate) Cancel
